WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:05.940
Well then, now that we're all 
here, why don't we begin?

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.340
On Moroha Haimura's Rank-S certification.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.710
<b>UK Executive 
Sir Edward Lampard</b>

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.260
<b>Russia Executive 
Vasilisa Yuryevna Mostvaya</b>

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.450
I oppose. Any objections?

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.480
<b>France Executive 
Charles Saint-Germain</b>

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:16.820
I agree with the Lightning Emperor of Russia.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:22.740
<b>Japan Executive 
Hayakawa Ando</b>

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.400
I'm in favor.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.230
He has the aptitude.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.000
And the rest of you?

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.620
<b>China Executive (representative) 
Lu Ji Xin</b>

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:30.000
I wouldn't dare impose.

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:36.880
<b>United States Executive 
Arlene Highbury</b>

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:36.890
<i>Do we even have enough information to 
measure what's-his-face's abilities?</i>

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.550
Don't worry.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:42.410
He defeated a nine-headed 
Metaphysical. He's a prodigy.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:43.390
And the evidence?

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:47.450
Haimura-kun disposed of the 
multi-head in an instant.

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:49.800
He didn't leave time for any records.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.040
This is what they mean when they say 
you put your foot in your mouth.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.150
Forget it.

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:59.160
How could you possibly expect us 
to accept it without any evidence?

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.160
I guess I can't agree either, then.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.250
Wait.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:09.040
I know where you're coming 
from. I was skeptical, too.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:10.450
That's why I—

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:14.880
Not at a time like this.

00:01:15.310 --> 00:01:16.930
What is it, Ando?

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:19.050
It's a Metaphysical.

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:13.460
<i>Target is maintaining speed.</i>

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:17.500
<i>Understood. Continue following 
it from a distance.</i>

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.380
<i>Understood.</i>

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:23.720
Three hundred meters in length.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:27.890
No! The Dreadnought Class 
is nothing compared to this.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:32.480
The Six Heads have called 
it the Fortress Class.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.400
So where is it now?

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.910
In the Sea of Japan, moving southward.

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:41.400
It'll be past this island's shores 
and reach Honshu in an hour.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.080
If that thing set foot on land...

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:45.830
It'd be a catastrophe.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.830
When are we getting backup?

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:51.410
Japan Headquarters is ordering us to retreat.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:04:00.250
They decided that we mustn't attack recklessly 
while the Japan Executive is absent.

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:02.620
I don't get it.

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:05.970
Didn't the principal go with 
him to the UK, as well?

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:11.010
Yes. Mari-oneechan's Transportal 
can bring them back right away.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:16.440
I don't know the details, but the 
brass must have made their decisions.

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:19.940
Are you going to follow their orders?

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:22.960
Their orders are absolute.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:29.220
Besides, as the leader of the squad, 
I can't lead you into a hopeless battle.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.250
Look! At that!

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.010
They should have been at a safe distance.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:51.600
It's either highly 
intelligent or aggressive.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.000
You understand now, don't you?

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:55.980
We have no time to waste.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:57.310
Gather your things immediately.

00:04:58.140 --> 00:05:00.350
The islanders are already being evacuated.

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:03.320
We'll follow them off the island.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.320
What's wrong?

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:12.150
I have a tummy ache all of a sudden!

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:16.330
I'll have to see a doctor on the mainland!

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:17.630
Bye!

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.340
Moroha.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:25.610
Go back to your rooms.

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:26.710
Let's prepare.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.980
This is interesting.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:41.930
Ando, you will not move a 
step from where you are.

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:42.980
What?

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:46.120
<i>What is this nonsense?</i>

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:49.720
<i>How are they going to defeat that thing 
without the Six Heads at the fronts?</i>

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.490
How is it nonsense?

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:56.560
Isn't there a man in Japan 
that may become Rank-S?

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:59.120
Ando has no reason to return.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:00.620
Good idea.

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:04.470
Sleep for a while.

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:07.090
That way you won't have to suffer, either.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:13.370
So you have a kind side. I'm impressed.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.120
He's as cute as he is young when he's asleep.

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:24.160
<i>You'll have to take care of it, Moroha.</i>

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:31.090
<i>Everyone, please evacuate calmly.</i>

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:36.010
<i>There are enough ships for everyone. 
Please evacuate calmly.</i>

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:40.250
Are you sure about this, Maya?

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:41.770
Yes.

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:44.380
I want to make myself useful, too.

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:45.860
Shizuno?

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:46.760
Obviously.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:48.540
Satsuki?

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:51.300
I don't want to run anymore.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.690
Aren't you retreating?

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:58.340
The strikers are, yeah.

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:02.210
But I'm neither a captain nor a squad member.

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:05.070
I'm just here as Isurugi Jin.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.190
"How can we call ourselves 
the swords of salvation

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.830
if we can't even save two girls," huh?

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:15.080
Those words struck me.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:20.560
There're only five of us, 
but depending on how we play it out...

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:22.300
You're counting wrong.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:29.210
We missed the boat.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.510
Let us fight with you.

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:34.430
Please.

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:38.700
Asses are more massive than the world.

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:40.270
That's why I fight.

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:41.970
Guys...

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:44.410
Anyway, what about our orders?

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:47.210
No, I'm not a captain right now.

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:50.490
Be a little more flexible. 
You're so stubborn.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.090
We are the swords of salvation.

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.550
We are the Saviors.

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:01.060
We are the Strike for our People, 
our Peace and our Justice.

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:06.920
We are the Strike for our People, 
our Peace and our Justice.

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:12.510
Sound?

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:13.930
Yeah.

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:18.540
The first victim was a fishing 
boat that was playing loud music.

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:19.370
And...

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:22.190
The Defense Force helicopter 
made a loud blast.

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:23.270
Right.

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:26.670
It's likely that the Fortress 
responds sensitively to sound.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.940
We'll form lines based on this fact.

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:33.690
It's here.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:36.860
Wh-What is that?

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:39.020
It's too big.

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:41.030
Stop warbling, chicks!

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:45.310
First we'll lure the Fortress 
towards the harbor siren.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:51.420
The Black Mage squad will make use of 
Shimon-kun's barrier as a safety zone

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.550
and attack from the left.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:56.150
It's headed toward the harbor.

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:57.460
Just as planned.

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:58.940
That's our captain.

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:01.310
It's like a moving island.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:03.760
Meanwhile, the Shirogane squad will focus on

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:05.720
providing cover for the Black Mage squad.

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:10.670
Momochi-kun will use her speed to 
relay messages between the squads.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:13.770
And when the Fortress becomes immobilized,

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:17.780
we'll have independent attacks 
from both the left and the front.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.700
I-Independent?

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.330
Who's doing it?

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:24.720
I'll be doing the left.

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:28.750
And I want you, Haimura-kun, 
to handle the front, where we expect

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:31.750
the most intense attacks.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:36.130
You say that so casually, Captain.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:54.530
It stopped.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.570
But now we can't...

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.070
We can't surround it.

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:03.620
What the?

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:06.330
Who is that?

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.080
Woohoo!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:12.060
I'm the party of the century!

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:15.840
I'm so awesome!

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:19.130
Kammie-senpai!

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:20.610
Fireworks.

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:22.140
It's moving.

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:34.260
Never mind, go away!

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.280
Kammie-senpai!

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:44.030
Run, Mannendo!

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.360
All right, it's in formation.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:52.680
Commence operation!

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:02.180
No way.

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.620
I had no idea.

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:04.530
I can't do it.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:05.620
It's already been explained.

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:06.680
It can be done.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:10.390
And you're already standing 
on the battlefield, Takenaka!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:15.150
You have nice balls.

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:16.070
You pass.

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:19.980
Step up, if any of you 
want to be checked, too!

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:24.780
Then let's proceed as planned.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:26.360
Write.

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:31.270
<b>Land of the Unreasonable, ground of the frozen, lend me your breath.</b>

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.540
Dreadful Blizzard.

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:40.800
Fell everything in the blink of an eye.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:41.850
Lightning!

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:42.780
Flare!

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:43.930
Hydrosquirt!

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:45.430
Incinerator!

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:55.740
We did it.

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:57.100
We did it!

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:59.440
It's too early to celebrate, you buffoons.

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:15.610
Surprise, surprise!

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:17.710
They came out of the Metaphysical!

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.000
More Metaphysicals!

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:23.240
Well it's not uncommon for giant 
insect types to have bugs inside.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:27.740
It's our job to exterminate them 
and protect the Dark Mage squad.

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:29.010
Don't forget that.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:30.770
R-Roger.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.690
Bring it on!

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:42.150
Stubborn, huh?

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:44.060
You're absolutely right.

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:45.160
And that's fine.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:48.740
Let's go. With honesty. With naiveté.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:55.620
My challenge to myself in this camp...

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:03.720
is to come even one step 
closer to Haimura-kun!

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:11.220
How can I become as powerful as you?

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.230
I think it's just a matter of spirit.

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.050
I get it, Haimura-kun.

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:28.410
I finally get it.

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:38.750
Start the music.

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:50.170
Come, Saratiga.

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:56.020
Let's go!

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:13.110
<b>The world of the decadent is unending. 
Let the trumpets blare. Come, moment of judgment!</b>

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:15.620
Black Gehenna!

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:21.050
Yin Yang Kurikara!

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:29.550
Sorry, but...

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:36.480
they told me not to let you through!

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:45.730
Senpai!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.600
You always make such a mess.

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:55.660
I wish you'd say I'm a jack 
of all trades, master of none.

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:58.860
Bimbo?

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:02.330
I see vermin!

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:06.840
Sophie-senpai makes even more of a mess.

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:10.430
Shoot.

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:21.650
This is because I didn't get to do 
grown-up lotion stuff with Haimura!

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:25.130
And this is because I didn't get to have 
Haimura take off my grown-up swimsuit!

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:28.510
My challenge at camp is 
to take it all out on you!

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:29.880
Die!

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:30.850
Take this!

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:31.950
And this!

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:36.790
It's scary what you can do when you're angry.

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:48.020
Captain Isurugi!

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:49.900
What's the status?

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:53.500
Sir, the Dark Mage squad has 
destroyed the left leg portion.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.220
They're now attacking the trunk.

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:58.210
All right, now we need Haimura-kun 
to take out the head.

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:03.760
What?

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.690
No, it's...

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.870
It was multi-headed?!

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:25.380
No, order everyone to retreat! Immediately!

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.240
Right!

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.570
My head's pounding.

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:45.920
Use defensive magic!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:47.770
I can't!

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:53.530
At this rate...

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:11.070
Guys.

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:13.450
Damn you.

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:15.930
Y-Yes.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:17.630
Shizuno!

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:20.320
I'm fine.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.970
{missing first part} Hurry...

00:17:29.870 --> 00:17:31.150
Shizuno!

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.320
Ranjou.

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:34.310
We have a retreat order.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:35.820
Hurry, bring everyone.

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:41.330
<i>Be pumped on the inside.</i>

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:45.290
<i>In fact, be strong of will, but calm of mind.</i>

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:49.000
Take care of the others.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:49.590
Ranjou.

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:55.920
<i>That Plana.</i>

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:08.190
I'm going to protect everyone 
until Nii-sama gets here!

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:17.750
What the?

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:18.990
Haimura!

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:21.670
Momo-senpai.

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:23.690
Satsuki went berserk.

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:26.500
She's as fervent as you and Captain.

00:18:27.930 --> 00:18:30.320
Satsuki's in danger.

00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:32.710
Run, Momo-senpai.

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:34.710
I'll defeat it.

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:35.500
What?

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:37.970
We wouldn't be having so much trouble 
if we could defeat it that easily.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:40.720
Still, it has to be done.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.230
Before it turns to face Satsuki.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.360
But what do I do?

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:51.230
I can't defeat it with a half-assed attack.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:56.650
I remember.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.170
That won't do, it's too shallow.

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:13.690
No, this is good.

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:15.590
Just get out of here, Momo-senpai.

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.330
Dammit, whatever!

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:22.390
I'll go down with you!

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:25.000
Moroha, I'll cover your rear.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:26.390
Thank you!

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:29.680
Come on, hang in there.

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:33.900
We're safe in my barrier.

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:35.270
Ranjou!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:44.870
Satsuki!

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:47.240
Nii-sama!

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:54.130
We're good here. Go retreat with the others.

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:56.460
I'm so glad.

00:19:58.430 --> 00:19:59.420
Satsuki!

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:00.440
I got this.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.430
Your running was awesome just now.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.460
Dammit...

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:27.490
If it does that thing now...

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:33.020
I...

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:41.530
I won't forgive anything that takes from me!

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:15.170
Oh? So they won.

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.680
Not bad.

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:18.130
Those are my men for you.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:24.130
<i>Um, yeah. I think what's-his-face 
is set for Rank-S.</i>

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:30.140
Well then, how's this?

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:36.770
Taking into consideration he'd 
only just recently awakened,

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:38.970
and that he's still a student,

00:21:38.970 --> 00:21:43.150
we'll treat him exclusively as 
a student until he graduates.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:45.970
So he gets three years parole.

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:49.070
Fair enough. He'll be working for me soon.

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:52.930
I'm so tired.

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:54.750
Me, too.

00:21:55.550 --> 00:21:56.580
Come on.

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:58.980
Don't your legs hurt?

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:00.770
What about you? Do you hurt anywhere?

00:22:00.770 --> 00:22:02.790
No, I actually feel good.

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:05.610
Let's do something that 
feels even better, then.

00:22:05.610 --> 00:22:06.590
Shizuno.

00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:08.740
Are your injuries better already?

00:22:08.740 --> 00:22:10.240
Yes, I'm fine.

00:22:10.670 --> 00:22:13.390
Maya-san gave me treatment.

00:22:13.740 --> 00:22:17.030
You have good complexion, too. 
Good for you, Urushibara.

00:22:17.030 --> 00:22:22.070
Huh, didn't you call me 
Shizuno earlier, Satsuki-san?

00:22:23.760 --> 00:22:26.640
You were out of it, so forget about it!

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:28.230
Ow, this pillow moves!

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:30.120
Maybe it's not a good pillow.

00:22:30.420 --> 00:22:32.790
My pillows are softer.

00:22:32.790 --> 00:22:33.810
Hey!

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:35.980
Stop talking like the vice captain!

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:37.690
Do you have a problem with me?

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:39.700
Crap!

00:22:39.700 --> 00:22:41.380
Good work, everyone.

00:22:41.740 --> 00:22:44.630
You did well treating 
everyone, too, Maya-chan.

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:48.480
I wish I could make myself more useful.

00:22:48.480 --> 00:22:50.200
No, you did great.

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:54.640
You guys, did you see me being a badass?

00:22:54.640 --> 00:22:56.390
Wasn't I awesome?

00:22:56.780 --> 00:22:59.400
Oh, yeah, what happened since then?

00:23:01.760 --> 00:23:06.050
He took a sonic attack and 
slept through the whole thing.

00:23:07.390 --> 00:23:11.960
Anyway, Ranjou, I heard you saved the 
Dark Mage squad from being wiped out.

00:23:11.960 --> 00:23:13.570
I'll praise you for now.

00:23:13.570 --> 00:23:16.000
It was nothing.

00:23:17.530 --> 00:23:19.270
So you can rest now.

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:23.260
I'll be Haimura 's pillow now.

00:23:23.260 --> 00:23:25.100
This is an order from your vice captain.

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:30.390
That's enough, Kanzaki-kun.

00:23:30.390 --> 00:23:32.660
Mercy!

00:23:35.360 --> 00:23:38.750
<i>The waves ebbing and flowing are a lullaby.</i>

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:43.930
<i>I prayed in my heart so that 
we, wearied from combat,</i>

00:23:43.930 --> 00:23:47.400
<i>may sleep well at least for today.</i>

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:58.160
You, go to Japan and take him down.

00:23:58.160 --> 00:23:59.120
Understood.

00:23:59.470 --> 00:24:03.630
He's a Rank-S. Do whatever it takes.

00:24:04.150 --> 00:24:08.420
Give your all to show them Russia's might.

00:24:08.780 --> 00:24:09.720
Yes, ma'am.

00:24:14.930 --> 00:24:24.810
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:18.470
I'm going to wait until that stubborn 
bastard's not looking, and then Haimura—

00:24:18.950 --> 00:24:21.750
Your head is as soft as 
a tomato, Kanzaki-kun.

00:24:21.750 --> 00:24:24.010
Next time, episode seven: 
"The Silver-haired Alien."

00:24:24.010 --> 00:24:25.010
Write!
